# Track precipitate and filtrate through drying
# Form barium sulfate twice. Filter both preparations, then dry only the
# second filtrate. Account for BaSO4 residue and the soluble spectator ions
# across each source-receiver system before deciding whether matter was lost.
register lv3
add v1 water 0.35L
add v1 BaCl2 0.0006mol
add v1 Na2SO4 0.0006mol
new
filter v1 v2
inspect v1
inspect v2
new
add v3 water 0.35L
add v3 BaCl2 0.0006mol
add v3 Na2SO4 0.0006mol
new
filter v3 v4
evaporate v4 1.0
inspect v3
inspect v4
# Simulation only: soluble barium salts are toxic. A physical version requires
# trained supervision, eye protection, gloves, and hazardous-waste collection.
